    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu matuku au disama diakakuata Abiya, muana wa Yalobama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalobama wakambila mukashi wandi ne, Bika, ndi nkusengelela ne, Udifuanyishe bu muntu mukuabo, bua bantu kabakumanyi bu mukashi wa Yalobama, uye ku Shilo kudi Ahiya, muprofete wa Nzambi, wakangambila ne, Wewe newikale mukelenge ku mutu kua bantu aba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uye ne mitanda ya bidia dikumi, ne mikata ne mulondo wa buitshi; yeye neakuambile mualua muana eu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukashi wa Yalobama wakenza nunku, wakajuka, wakaya ku Shilo, wakafika ku nsubu wa Ahiya. Ahiya wakadi mufofo, mesu andi akadi bileshileshi bua bununu buandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila Ahiya ne, Tangila, mukashi wa Yalobama ulualua kukuebesha bualu bua muanʼandi; bualu bua yeye udi usama; nunku umuambile mei kampanda; bualu bua habueleye kudi, yeye neadifuanyikishe bu mukashi mukuabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku hakunvua Ahiya kusesa kua makasa andi hakabueleye ku tshibi, yeye wakamuambila ne, Buela biebe, mukashi wa Yalobama; udi udifuanyikisha bu muntu mukuabo bua tshinyi? Bualu bua bundi nʼabu mbua kukuambila mei adi anemesha bujitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya, wambile Yalobama ne. Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Bualu bua meme nakakutumbisha munkatshi mua bantu, nakakusungula mukelenge ku mutu kua bantu banyi Bena Isalele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakanyenga bukelenge kudi ba mu nsubu wa Davidi, nakakuhabu; kadi wewe kuakuenza bu muntu wanyi Davidi, wakatumikila mikenji yanyi, wakandonda ne mutshima wandi wonso, bua kuakuenza malu akadi mimpe ku mesu kuanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi wewe wakutamba bantu bonso bakadi ku mpala kuebe bua kuenza bibi, wa kudienzela nzambi mikuabo, wakutula mpingu bua kunfuisha nʼai tshiji, wakungela meme ku nyima kuebe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku nentume malu mabi kudi ba mu nsubu wa Yalobama, nenshihe bana balume bonso ba mu nsubu wa Yalobama ne badi mu nsubu wandi ne badi ha bule mu Isalele; nenkombe ba mu nsubu wa Yalobama bu mudibo bakomba diala dia butue, tô ne hashikadi dionso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hafua wa mu nsubu wa Yalobama mu musoko, mbua neyimudie; biafuileye mu mpata, nyunyu ya mulu neyimuzokole; bualu bua Yehowa wakuamba dî edi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku ujuke biebe, hingana ku nsubu kuebe; hafika makasa ebe ku musoko, muana neafue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele bonso nebamujinge, nebamujike, bualu bua nebamujike anu yeye wa mu nsubu wa Yalobama, bualu bua yeye udi ne tshituha tshia malu adi asankisha Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, munda muandi mu nsubu wa Yalobama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa neadisunguile mukelenge mukuabo ha mutu ha Bena Isalele, yeye neashihe bonso ba mu nsubu wa Yalobama mu dituku adi; yeye kena muenze nunku katataka, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E, bulelela, Yehowa neakume Bena Isalele bu mudi mai anyungisha disele; neajule Bena Isalele mu buloba ebu buimpe buakaheye bankambua babo, neabamuangalashe dishiya dia musulu wa Pelata, bualu bua bobo bakadienzela Bashela bua kufuisha nʼai Yehowa tshiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye nealekele Bena Isalele bua malu mabi akenza Yalobama ne bua malu mabi akenzesheye Bena Isalele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukashi wa Yalobama wakajuka, wakaya, wakahingana ku Tîsa; hakafikeye ku mbelu kua nsubu, muana wakafua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele bonso bakamujika, bakamujinga bu muakadi dî dia Yehowa diakambeye mukana mua muprofete wandi Ahiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedibia Yalobama bikuabo, muakaluanganeye ne muakakokesheye bidi bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matuku onso akakokesha Yalobama bantu akadi bidimu makumi abidi ne bibidi; wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi; Nadaba, muana wandi, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lehabama, muana wa Solomo, wakakokesha mu Yuda. Lehabama wakadi ne bidimu makumi anai ne tshimue hakabangeye kukokesha, yeye wakakokesha bidimu dikumi ne muanda mutekete mu Yelushalema, musoko wakasungula Yehowa munkatshi mua bisamba bionso bia Bena Isalele bua kutekamu dina diandi; dina dia mamu wandi diakadi Nâma, Muena Amona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Yuda bakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa; bobo bakatamba kumufuisha mukau ne malu mabi akenzabo akahita a batatuʼabo bubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bobo bakenza bitendelelu ne makunshi a kutendelela ne Bashela ha mutu ha mikuna yonso ne muinshi mua mitshi mibishi yonso; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bena Sodoma kabidi bakadi mu buloba; bobo bakenza malu onso a bundu akenza bisamba abi biakadi Yehowa muihate ku mesu kua Bena Isalele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshitanu tshia bukelenge bua Lehabama, Shishaka, mukelenge wa Ejipitu, wakalua ku Yelushalema; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakahaula bintu bionso bia mu nsubu wa Yehowa ne bia mu nsubu wa mukelenge, wakaya ne buonso buabi; wakanyenga ngabu ya or yakenza Solomo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Lehabama Wakenza ngabu ya tshiamu tshia mitaku, wakayiteka mu bianza bia tupitene tuakadi tulama nsubu wa mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misangu yonso hakaya mukelenge mu nsubu wa Yehowa, balami bakadi baya nʼai, bakahingana nʼai mu nsubu wabo kabidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bia Lehabama bikuabo ne malu onso akenzeye kabiena bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Yuda, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lehabama ne Yalobama bakadi baluangana nvita matuku onso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lehabama wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi. Bakamujika mu lukita lua bankambua bandi mu musoko wa Davidi; dina dia mamu wandi diakadi Nama, Muena Amona. Abiyama, muanʼandi wa balume, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
